<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $0.75 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $0.75 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.75 lower compared to Thursday. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    56.50-57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>US 3-4	290-310 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-550 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	550-700 lbs    49.00</p>
</text>
